SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The mmkkffiiffoo() system call is expected to conform to ISO/IEC 9945-1:1990
     (“POSIX.1”).  The mmkkffiiffooaatt() system call follows The Open Group Extended
     API Set 2 specification.

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The mmkkffiiffooaatt() system call appeared in FreeBSD 8.0.

